Luna...

273
00:15:36,780 --> 00:15:40,780
Come here. I need to have a word with you.

274
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,780
I'm not saving you.

275
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,780
That prank you pulled was really dangerous.

276
00:15:48,780 --> 00:15:51,780
Think about what you did.

277
00:15:51,780 --> 00:15:53,780
Let's go.

278
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:04,780
Oh? Akanechi?

279
00:16:04,780 --> 00:16:06,780
My stomach just started hurting.

280
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:08,780
Stomach? Not your leg?

281
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:14,780
Huh? Uh, well, yeah. You know, it's like the pain worked its way up to my stomach.

282
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:16,780
What?

283
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:19,780
If the pain is so severe, perhaps you should take the medication I gave you earlier.

284
00:16:19,780 --> 00:16:22,780
Look here! Don't you even think about talking to Akane again!

285
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:24,780
Why is he still here?

286
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:28,780
Those aren't very effective. They wouldn't do anything.

287
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:34,780
Only category one OTC pain relievers dispensed by a pharmacist would do the trick for pain like this.

288
00:16:34,780 --> 00:16:35,780
A category what?

289
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:40,780
If you walk about 500 meters that way towards the station, there should be a drug store to the right.

290
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:42,780
Oh, uh, of course. I'll head over there right away.

291
00:16:42,780 --> 00:16:44,780
No! I'll go!

292
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:49,780
Would you rub my belly, Runa?

293
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:55,780
Oh, and since I'd worry about Eita going shopping on his own, I'd feel better if you weren't with him, Yamada and Mr. Komota.

294
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,780
You, on the other hand, can go away now!

295
00:17:12,780 --> 00:17:13,780
No!

296
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:28,780
And that, maybe you'd speak?

297
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:29,780
I dunno..

298
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:31,780
I don't wanna study things here before you call this complex book.

299
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:32,780
It's a huge point.

300
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:33,780
Okay.

301
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:35,000
Yep, Ish-

302
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,780
This is so scolding the key to Comm crisp,ή up and brush.

303
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,780
So Runa! What level are you?

304
00:17:39,780 --> 00:17:45,920
Oh, sorry. I was talking about Voss.

305
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:50,380
Well, um, two are maxed out, but I don't really keep track of my alts.

306
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:54,260
Then I guess we can't go hunting together, can we?

307
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,220
With my level being so low and all.

308
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:59,160
Our level difference is too great, right?

309
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:01,840
I asked Yamada once, and he turned me down.

310
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,660
You want me to hunt with you?

311
00:18:04,060 --> 00:18:06,260
There's too much of a level difference between us,

312
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:08,440
so it wouldn't be worth the XP penalty.

313
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,600
No, I wouldn't really be bothered by that.

314
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:15,440
And I've still got a low-level character, too, so...

315
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:18,720
Yeah? Then let's go hunting together sometime.

316
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,500
I'm currently playing as a paladin.

317
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:22,980
What job class are you?

318
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,620
How can you talk like nothing happened?

319
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:27,620
I stood you up. Didn't you think that was weird?

320
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:29,440
Oh, well...

321
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,860
I bailed on you on purpose.

322
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:35,640
I wanted to put you on the spot,

323
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,080
because I really can't stand you, Akane.

324
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,140
I wanted to make you leave the guilt.

325
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:43,020
I thought if I sent over some weirdo,

326
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,780
you wouldn't like online games anymore.

327
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:49,040
I have to admit, I was pretty freaked out.

328
00:18:49,040 --> 00:18:59,240
Did you... hurt yourself?

329
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,080
If you're getting a lecture,

330
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:11,220
I think I'll let your brother handle it.

331
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:18,280
I came here today to figure out how we can get along with each other.

332
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:23,100
You're all such wonderful people.

333
00:19:23,780 --> 00:19:27,800
So I'm realizing that joining this guild has been one of my biggest sources of joy.

334
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:31,820
But I know that they're your precious friends, too, aren't they?

335
00:19:34,120 --> 00:19:37,960
That's why I wanted to meet up and ask you to welcome me into your inner circle as well.

336
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:39,240
Please, Runa!

337
00:19:39,240 --> 00:20:05,300
I'm so sorry.

338
00:20:05,300 --> 00:20:11,880
I'm really sorry for being so mean.

339
00:20:23,940 --> 00:20:26,980
Adolescent girls sure can be quite the handful, can't they?

340
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:31,600
Who ever would have thought that sweet little Runa would lash out so hard at Akane?

341
00:20:32,040 --> 00:20:33,780
I'm at the end of my rope.

342
00:20:34,340 --> 00:20:37,360
To think she was so obedient and cute as a child.

343
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,560
I don't know what I'm going to do with her.

344
00:20:40,560 --> 00:21:00,740
Welcome back, guys!

345
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:06,760
Akane, is your stomach feeling any better?

346
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:07,440
What?

347
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:08,360
Oh, yeah!

348
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:10,560
It feels much better now.

349
00:21:11,020 --> 00:21:13,500
I guess having Runa rub it for me really did the job.

350
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:54,320
That was some disaster.

351
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:55,000
Huh?

352
00:22:55,520 --> 00:22:59,580
I mean, you were excited about today, only to get pranked by Runa.

353
00:23:00,060 --> 00:23:03,280
Ah, it's not all on her.

354
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:07,260
I could have easily gone home when I saw a stranger waiting on our meetup spot.

355
00:23:07,800 --> 00:23:09,580
And sure, it did tick me off a little.

356
00:23:10,060 --> 00:23:13,080
But I was mostly disappointed that we didn't get to just hang out.

357
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:17,040
Still though, I'm not done yet.

358
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:19,520
I may be hopeless in terms of romance.

359
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:23,460
But when it comes to making friends with other girls, I'm a certified pro.

360
00:23:24,500 --> 00:23:27,200
So I bet I can get closer to her one of these days.

361
00:23:29,380 --> 00:23:33,360
As expected from my lady, your overwhelming kindness is just as rumored.

362
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:34,580
You're truly a muse.

363
00:23:34,900 --> 00:23:37,580
Please go out with me with the intention of getting married one day.

364
00:23:37,600 --> 00:23:38,680
Just go home, please!

